  "body": "On offer is an exceptional opportunity to secure brand-new, high-quality homes  in the heart of Milford, one of the North Shore's most sought-after coastal suburbs. \r\n\r\nLocated at 2 Rangitoto Terrace only two residences remain  for discerning buyers - 2A and 2B.  Each home offers a unique floor plan while delivering the same commitment to quality, comfort and contemporary living.\r\n\r\nDesigned for Modern Living\r\n* Four generous bedrooms\r\n* Three stylish bathrooms\r\n* Two master suites with ensuites\r\n* Spacious open-plan living and dining\r\n* Designer kitchens with quality finishes\r\n* Internal-access garaging\r\n* Easy-care, low-maintenance living\r\n\r\n2 Rangitoto Terrace, Milford | 2A & 2B available\r\n2A - Family Favourite\r\n*      One of the largest layouts in the development\r\n*\tSpacious living and entertaining areas\r\n*\tIdeal for growing families\r\n\r\n2B - Premium Residence\r\n*\tSea views\r\n*\tPrivate lift for easy access across all levels\r\n*\tPerfect for multi-generational living or future-proof comfort\r\n\r\nPremium Milford Lifestyle\r\n* Easy walk to Milford Village, cafés, restaurants and boutique shopping\r\n* Stroll to Milford Beach and enjoy the best of seaside living\r\n* Convenient access to public transport and motorway connections\r\n* Zoned for Milford Primary, Takapuna Normal Intermediate, Westlake Boys' High School and Westlake Girls' High School\r\n\r\nWhether you're upsizing, downsizing, investing, or searching for a brand-new family home in a prestigious location, these thoughtfully designed residences represent a rare opportunity in a tightly held neighbourhood.\r\n\r\nOnly three homes remain. Enquire today and secure your preferred residence before it's gone.\r\n\r\nTo download property documents: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/FJM4",
